{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrillionniumFoundation/hepta-private-ci/pulls/3039","id":4950671633,"node_id":"PR_kwDOTrgxoM8AAAABJxVBEQ","html_url":"https://github.com/TrillionniumFoundation/hepta-private-ci/pull/3039","diff_url":"https://github.com/TrillionniumFoundation/hepta-private-ci/pull/3039.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/TrillionniumFoundation/hepta-private-ci/pull/3039.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrillionniumFoundation/hepta-private-ci/issues/3039","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrillionniumFoundation/hepta-private-ci/pulls/3039/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrillionniumFoundation/hepta-private-ci/pulls/3039/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrillionniumFoundation/hepta-private-ci/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrillionniumFoundation/hepta-private-ci/issues/3039/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrillionniumFoundation/hepta-private-ci/statuses/9da3c2b98bf427c5812cdc332d4adda1fc23bac6","number":3039,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"research: add NDU multimodal portfolio pilot and unconfirmed heldout replication","user":{"login":"Franksudoman","id":273670192,"node_id":"U_kgDOEE_gMA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/273670192?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Franksudoman","html_url":"https://github.com/Franksudoman","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Franksudoman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Franksudoman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Franksudoman/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Franksudoman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Franksudoman/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Franksudoman/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Franksudoman/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Franksudoman/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Franksudoman/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Why\n\nThe proposed Hepta/NDU multimodal output-portfolio mechanism needs an executable, falsifiable first test with actual learned encoders and generated outputs. This isolated pilot establishes that test and preserves negative as well as positive evidence.\n\n## What changes\n\n- Add a 660,488-parameter four-modality synthetic model, calibrated joint-error model, finite NDU-inspired controller, seven frozen comparison arms and explicit cost accounting.\n- Preregister the primary CVaR90 endpoint, three seeds, quality/cost tolerances and an independently implemented bottom-up oracle.\n- Add a narrowly triggered workflow for the project's existing dedicated self-hosted runner, including source/runner receipts and partial-evidence upload.\n- Preserve development, v1 and amended v1.1 results, per-seed summaries, independent replay reviews and finite risk-cost plots.\n\nThe post-v1 review found a support-constraint fallback error in 11 secondary budget-7 static-baseline cases. The published v1.1 amendment fixes it and uses disjoint heldout worlds without changing the endpoint, thresholds, training, calibration or main selection.\n\n## Current result: primary efficacy not confirmed\n\nOn the new heldout v1.1 sample, NDU minus the strong static portfolio has CVaR90 difference **-0.015166**, 95% CI **[-0.042590, +0.009443]**. It fails the preregistered absolute reduction of 0.020 and the interval-below-zero condition. Original v1 was positive; both rounds remain in the record and are not pooled.\n\nAt the primary budget, recursive and myopic NDU are identical. Incremental benefit over fixed-risk DP is not established. NDU has more ambiguous outputs; correlation-shift and all-shared-wrong failures remain visible. This does not establish a foundation-model, native Hepta, NDU joint-training or diffusion-model advantage.\n\nCurrent report: [RESULTS_V1_1.md](experiments/multimodal_output_portfolio/evidence/RESULTS_V1_1.md).\n\n## Validation\n\n- Full v1.1 local CPU evaluation: 3 seeds, 8,064 heldout worlds, 169,344 policy/world rows, 189 summary groups.\n- 32 independent oracle audits, 403,712 augmented-state checks, maximum value error 1.7819e-14, no decision mismatches.\n- Independent raw-input/checkpoint replay, summary and bootstrap recomputation, all recorded evidence/source hashes, traces, budgets, MAC counts and portfolio support pass.\n- Both rounds share identical trained weights and calibration; heldout world IDs have no overlap. They are not six independent training seeds.\n- Python/shell validation completed. `just fmt` could not run because `just` is absent; this PR changes no Rust files.\n\n## Remaining execution blocker\n\n[Dedicated v1.1 run 39589317563](https://github.com/TrillionniumFoundation/hepta-private-ci/actions/runs/39589317563) is accepted but unassigned: job 119186004831 has runner_id=0 and no execution steps. The superseded v1 request is cancelled. The workflow can proceed when the configured dedicated runner is available; no cloud success is claimed.\n\nKeep this PR in draft: implementation/evidence are reviewable, but the requested dedicated-cloud execution and the primary scientific claim are not satisfied.","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-21T11:17:14Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T11:17:14Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"43148188e68d9506e98846edc25d6d0ffecd0646","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"TrillionniumFoundation:research/ndu-output-portfolio-20261021","ref":"research/ndu-output-portfolio-20261021","repo":{"id":1320694176,"node_id":"R_kgDOTrgxoA","name":"hepta-private-ci","full_name":"TrillionniumFoundation/hepta-private-ci","owner":{"login":"TrillionniumFoundation","id":262513357,"